message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "identifiability"
abstract: >-
  Four checks for whether a fitted curve, and the quantities derived from it,
  are identifiable from the available data: an empirical null distribution for
  R-squared, leave-one-out parameter stability, local-slope conditioning for
  inversion, and the sample size a given effect requires.
